Project Roadmap: MyIAM AI Chatbot ImplementationPhase 1: Foundation & Knowledge Retrieval (RAG)Focus: Quality, Accuracy, and Knowledge Base (KB) Maturity.TimelineMilestoneKey ActivitiesWeeks 1-2POC Testing & Feedback• UAT (Paris): Scoring RAG accuracy & identifying "Hallucinations."• SME (India): KB audit & Edge Case preparation.• Lab: Prompt Engineering & Top-k parameter optimization.Weeks 3-4Refinement & Architecture• Lab: Improved RAG release & API Spec (I/O) documentation.• Dev (India): MyIAM API discovery & Middleware/Wrapper development.• PM (Paris): Defining Phase 2 Read-only User Stories.Weeks 5-6Conclusion & Handover• Final Evaluation: "Go/No-Go" for RAG production readiness.• Dev (India): Sandbox deployment of Read-only APIs & Security testing.• Lab: Research on Agentic logic (Function Calling).Phase 2: Actionability & System Integration (Agentic)Focus: Real-time Data, Security, and Scalability.TimelineMilestoneKey ActivitiesWeeks 7-8API & Security Integration• Dev (India): Core Endpoint delivery & OAuth2/Identity-based auth.• Lab: Function Calling integration & JSON-to-Dialogue templates.• PM (Paris): Defining Data Privacy boundaries (Sensitive Data masking).Weeks 9-10Logic & Context Tuning• Lab: Implementation of Multi-turn dialogue (Context Retention).• SME (India): Data Parity UAT (AI vs. MyIAM Portal).• PM (Paris): Designing Fallback Strategies for API failures.Weeks 11-12Stress Test & Pilot• Dev (India): Load testing (High-concurrency for 500+ managers).• Joint Team: Internal Beta Launch (Canary Release).• Feedback: Measuring Phase 2 NPS and qualitative user feedback.Key Success Metrics (KPIs)Accuracy Rate: Target > 90% for RAG answers (Phase 1).Data Parity: 100% alignment between Chatbot and MyIAM portal data (Phase 2).Latency: API response + AI processing time under 3 seconds.User Adoption: NPS score > 40 during the Pilot phase.Strategic Note for the PM:Phase 1 is about Trust: If the bot gives wrong info here, users won't trust it to perform actions later.Phase 2 is about Utility: This is where the real "ROI" comes from, by saving managers time on manual status checks.
